### Module 3 — Users (`/admin/users`)
**APIs:** `GET /admin/users/treasurers`, `GET /admin/users/treasurers/{id}`, `GET /admin/users/treasurers/{id}/groups`, `POST /admin/users/treasurers/{id}/status`, `PATCH /admin/users/treasurers/{id}`, `PATCH /admin/users/treasurers/{id}/role`, `POST /admin/users/treasurers/{id}/plan`

- Paginated table: Name, Email, Phone, Status (Active / Suspended `Badge`), Joined, Actions
- Filter bar: status, search
- Row action → opens a `Sheet` with tabs: **Profile | Groups | Plan**
- Actions behind confirmation dialogs: Suspend / Reactivate, Edit Profile, Change Role, Override Plan

**New components:** `AdminUsersPage`, `AdminUsersTable`, `UserDetailSheet`, `SuspendUserDialog`, `ChangeRoleDialog`, `OverridePlanDialog`

